{"seq":2,"slug":"rm-free-methods","title":"免奖励模型方法：DPO 如何把奖励折叠进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reward-modeling-rlhf/practice/rm-free-methods","wordCount":1590,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"免奖励模型方法-dpo-如何把奖励折叠进策略\">免奖励模型方法：DPO 如何把奖励折叠进策略</h1><p>2023 年一篇论文提出了一个近乎&quot;作弊&quot;的想法：你训奖励模型、再跑 PPO 的那一整套繁琐流程，其实可以用一个数学变换直接跳过——把奖励模型和强化学习一起消掉，只留下一个对策略本身的简单分类损失。这就是 DPO（Direct Preference Optimization）。它不是&quot;用了更好的奖励模型&quot;，而是<strong>根本不显式训练奖励模型</strong>。这一篇讲这个变换为什么成立、奖励去哪了、以及由它衍生出的 SimPO、KTO、IPO、ORPO 一大家子方法各自在解决什么。它是 <a href=\"../foundations/reward-model-taxonomy\">奖励模型谱系</a> 里&quot;隐式奖励&quot;那一支的完整展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-奖励并没消失-只是变隐式了\">核心概念：奖励并没消失，只是变隐式了</h2><p>DPO 的出发点是 RLHF 那个带 KL 惩罚的优化目标（见 <a href=\"../challenges/over-optimization\">过度优化</a>）。这个目标有一个已知的<strong>闭式最优解</strong>：最优策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与参考策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_{\\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi^*(y) \\propto \\pi_{\\text{ref}}(y)\\exp(r(y)/\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。DPO 的关键一步是把这个关系反解，用策略反过来表达奖励：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(y) = \\beta \\log \\frac{\\pi^*(y \\mid x)}{\\pi_{\\text{ref}}(y \\mid x)} + \\beta \\log Z(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把这个&quot;隐式奖励&quot;代进 <a href=\"../training/bradley-terry\">Bradley-Terry</a> 损失，那个讨厌的配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 因为只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>、在成对相减时<strong>完全抵消</strong>，于是整个 RLHF 坍缩成一个直接作用在策略上的损失：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>DPO</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{DPO}} = -\\log \\sigma\\left(\\beta \\log \\frac{\\pi_\\theta(y_w \\mid x)}{\\pi_{\\text{ref}}(y_w \\mid x)} - \\beta \\log \\frac{\\pi_\\theta(y_l \\mid x)}{\\pi_{\\text{ref}}(y_l \\mid x)}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DPO</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[RLHF 目标&lt;br/&gt;奖励 + KL 惩罚] --&gt; B[闭式最优解&lt;br/&gt;pi_star 正比 pi_ref exp of r]&#10;    B --&gt; C[反解: 用策略表达奖励&lt;br/&gt;r = beta log 比值]&#10;    C --&gt; D[代入 Bradley-Terry]&#10;    D --&gt; E[配分函数 Z 相减抵消]&#10;    E --&gt; F[DPO 损失&lt;br/&gt;直接作用于策略]&#10;    F --&gt; G[无需奖励模型&lt;br/&gt;无需 RL 采样循环]\">flowchart TD\n    A[RLHF 目标&lt;br/&gt;奖励 + KL 惩罚] --&gt; B[闭式最优解&lt;br/&gt;pi_star 正比 pi_ref exp of r]\n    B --&gt; C[反解: 用策略表达奖励&lt;br/&gt;r = beta log 比值]\n    C --&gt; D[代入 Bradley-Terry]\n    D --&gt; E[配分函数 Z 相减抵消]\n    E --&gt; F[DPO 损失&lt;br/&gt;直接作用于策略]\n    F --&gt; G[无需奖励模型&lt;br/&gt;无需 RL 采样循环]</pre><p>奖励在 DPO 里以&quot;策略与参考模型的对数概率比&quot;的形式<strong>隐式存在</strong>——它从未被实例化成一个网络，却仍在暗中定义着什么算好。理解这一点很重要：DPO 不是逃离了奖励建模，而是把奖励建模和策略优化压进了同一个损失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dpo-相对显式-rm-ppo-的取舍\">DPO 相对显式 RM + PPO 的取舍</h2><p>DPO 的吸引力是工程上的巨大简化：不用训第二个模型、不用跑不稳定的 PPO 采样循环、显存和调参负担骤降，一台机器几小时就能对齐一个模型。但天下没有免费午餐：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>显式 RM + PPO</th>\n<th>DPO 一系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练复杂度</td>\n<td>高（两模型 + RL 循环）</td>\n<td>低（一个分类损失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>较难调（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>、采样）</td>\n<td>稳定、可复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据利用</td>\n<td>可在线采新样本</td>\n<td>通常离线固定数据集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖励复用</td>\n<td>奖励模型可独立复用</td>\n<td>隐式奖励绑死这次训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布外</td>\n<td>可迭代重训缓解</td>\n<td>易在离线数据外泛化差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度优化</td>\n<td>KL 显式可控</td>\n<td>隐式，仍会过优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心权衡在&quot;在线 vs 离线&quot;：PPO 能在训练中不断采样策略的新回答、用奖励模型现场打分，从而缓解 <a href=\"../challenges/over-optimization\">过度优化</a>；标准 DPO 在一个固定的离线偏好集上训练，一旦策略偏离该数据覆盖的分布，隐式奖励就失去约束。这也是为什么&quot;DPO 更简单&quot;不等于&quot;DPO 更好&quot;——它把复杂度换成了对数据覆盖的更强依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dpo-家族-一批修补各自痛点的变体\">DPO 家族：一批修补各自痛点的变体</h2><p>原始 DPO 暴露出几个问题，催生了一整个家族，每个成员针对一个具体痛点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SimPO</strong>：DPO 需要一个参考模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_{\\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 常驻显存。SimPO 干脆去掉参考模型，改用长度归一化的平均对数概率当隐式奖励，更省内存，还顺带缓解长度偏置。</li>\n<li><strong>KTO</strong>（Kahneman-Tversky Optimization）：DPO 要成对的&quot;胜/负&quot;数据，但现实中很多反馈是<strong>单点</strong>的（这条回答是好/坏，没有配对）。KTO 借前景理论，只需单条回答的好坏标签即可训练，大幅放宽数据要求。</li>\n<li><strong>IPO</strong>：DPO 在近乎确定的偏好上会过拟合（把概率推向极端）。IPO 换了个不带 sigmoid 饱和的目标，加正则防止这种过拟合。</li>\n<li><strong>ORPO</strong>：把 SFT 和偏好对齐合成一个阶段、一个损失，省掉单独的 SFT，用一个 odds-ratio 项同时做指令跟随和偏好对齐。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些变体的共同主题是在&quot;简单&quot;和&quot;可控/数据友好&quot;之间找不同的平衡点。选哪个取决于你的数据形态（成对还是单点）、显存预算、以及对过拟合的敏感度。DPO 及其变体的更系统对比见 <a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/direct-methods/dpo\">54 号直接方法篇</a> 与 <a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/direct-methods/dpo-variants\">变体篇</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"和可验证奖励-grpo-的关系\">和可验证奖励、GRPO 的关系</h2><p>DPO 一系解决的是<strong>主观偏好</strong>的对齐，而 2025 年推理任务的主战场是<strong>可验证奖励</strong>（见 <a href=\"process-outcome\">过程与结果奖励</a>）。这里不能用 DPO——可验证奖励是在线采样、程序判定的，天然需要一个 RL 循环。于是 GRPO（Group Relative Policy Optimization）这类方法登场：它保留了 RL 的在线采样，但用&quot;一组采样回答的相对得分&quot;取代了价值网络，比 PPO 更省、更适合可验证奖励。所以 2026 年的真实栈往往是<strong>分工</strong>的：DPO/SimPO 做通用主观对齐（离线、简单），GRPO + 可验证奖励攻推理（在线、免疫黑客）。把 DPO 和 GRPO 对立起来是误解，它们服务于不同任务类型。这条分工线是 <a href=\"reward-modeling-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 决策指南的骨架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>DPO 用 RLHF 目标的闭式最优解反解出隐式奖励，代入 Bradley-Terry 后配分函数抵消，坍缩成一个直接作用于策略的分类损失。</li>\n<li>奖励在 DPO 里没消失，而是变成&quot;策略与参考模型的对数概率比&quot;，隐式存在、不再实例化成网络。</li>\n<li>DPO 换来训练简化与稳定，代价是通常离线、对数据覆盖依赖强、隐式奖励不可复用，且仍会过度优化。</li>\n<li>家族成员各修一痛点：SimPO 去参考模型省显存、KTO 用单点数据、IPO 防过拟合、ORPO 合并 SFT 与对齐。</li>\n<li>DPO 一系管主观偏好，可验证任务用 GRPO + 可验证奖励，二者分工而非对立，构成 2026 年主流后训练栈。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/reward-model-taxonomy\">奖励模型谱系</a> 定位隐式奖励这一支；<a href=\"../challenges/over-optimization\">过度优化</a> 提供 DPO 反解所依赖的 KL 目标；<a href=\"process-outcome\">过程与结果奖励</a> 讲 GRPO 服务的可验证奖励。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/direct-methods/dpo\">54_rlhf-preference-alignment / DPO</a> 与 <a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/direct-methods/dpo-variants\">DPO 变体</a> 系统对比家族成员；<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/alignment-techniques/dpo\">27_llm-fine-tuning / DPO</a> 从微调实操角度落地 DPO。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"免奖励模型方法：DPO 如何把奖励折叠进策略","id":"免奖励模型方法-dpo-如何把奖励折叠进策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：奖励并没消失，只是变隐式了","id":"核心概念-奖励并没消失-只是变隐式了"},{"level":2,"text":"DPO 相对显式 RM + PPO 的取舍","id":"dpo-相对显式-rm-ppo-的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"DPO 家族：一批修补各自痛点的变体","id":"dpo-家族-一批修补各自痛点的变体"},{"level":2,"text":"和可验证奖励、GRPO 的关系","id":"和可验证奖励-grpo-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"过程与结果奖励：给答案打分，还是给每一步打分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reward-modeling-rlhf/practice/process-outcome"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：一个对齐项目该选哪条路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reward-modeling-rlhf/practice/reward-modeling-in-practice"}}